{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e61ae13a-d7e0-52f3-b996-4b320b983a01",
    "name": "MargenX - Colaboradores API",
    "description": "Equipo de la cuenta (#395, ADR-008): RBAC y validaciones de /api/auth/invitations y /api/auth/users. No crea invitaciones reales para no mandar mails; el alta de punta a punta se prueba en staging (README-Colaboradores.md).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Preparación",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/auth/me - guarda el id del ADMIN",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "me"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const user = pm.response.json().user;",
                  "pm.test('el token es de un ADMIN', function () { pm.expect(user.role).to.eql('ADMIN'); });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('adminUserId', user.id);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
